  "id": "BIT-rclone-2026-79780",
  "summary": "rclone before v1.75.0 Credential Exposure via S3 Redirect",
  "details": "rclone before v1.75.0 fails to sanitize IBM IAM bearer tokens and SSE-C encryption keys during S3 redirect callbacks, allowing credentials to be preserved across scheme or host changes. Attackers observing network traffic from a trusted endpoint can capture reusable IBM IAM tokens on same-host HTTPS-to-HTTP downgrades or SSE-C keys on cross-origin redirects to access protected S3 objects.",
  "aliases": [
    "CVE-2026-79780"
